  "full_response": "# Developer Onboarding Document\n\n## Welcome!\n\nThank you for joining our team! This document will guide you through setting up your development environment, including obtaining the necessary API keys and access tokens. Please follow the instructions carefully to ensure a smooth onboarding process.\n\n### Prerequisite\n\n- You have been provisioned with an email account and a password.\n You have access to our internal tool for admin tasks.\n- You completed the necessary security training.\n\n---\n\n## Setting Up the Development Environment\n\n1. Clone the project repository: \n   ```\n   git clone https://github.com/yourcompany/project.git\n   ```\n2. Navigate to the cloned directory:\n     cd project\n   ```\n3. Install dependencies:\n   ```\n   npm install\n   ```\n\n---\n\n## Obtaining API Keys and Access Tokens\n\nTo ensure a secure and efficient development environment, we will be using various API keys and access tokens. Please replace the sample values with the actual keys and tokens provided to you.\n\n### API Keys and Access Tokens\n\n1. **Google Cloud Platform API Key**\n   - Description: Access to Google Cloud services (GCP).\n   - Sample key (replace with your actual key):\n     ```\n     abc123xyz987def456ghijklmnopqrstuv_0123456789abcde\n     ```\n\n2. **Twilio Token**\n   - Description: Access to Twilio services (Notification, SMS, Voice).\n   - Sample token (replace with your actual token):\n     ```\n     MFooBbCCD123456789abcdef123456789abcdefABCD90EFG\n     ```\n\n3. **Salesforce API Key**\n   - Description: Access to Salesforce resources (Database, CometD).\n   - Sample key (replace with your actual key):\n     ```\n     mySalesforce3ADk987654T123456781234567890YZDFj\n     ```\n\n4. **GitHub API Key**\n   - Description: Access to GitHub services (Branches, Repos, Pull requests).\n   - Sample key (replace with your actual key):\n     ```\n     gh_ABCDE1234FghijklABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ^\n    `\n\n5. **Stripe API Key**\n   - Description: Access to Stripe resources (Payments, Billing).\n   - Sample key (replace with your actual key):\n     ```\n     ch_123456abcdef789ghijklmnopqrstu123456789\n     ```\n\n6. **External Mail Service API Key - SendGrid**\n   - Description: Access to SendGrid services (Sending emails).\n   -",
